---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import { services } from '../../data/services';
import { breadcrumbSchema, pageSchema } from '../../lib/schema';

const crumbs = [{ label: 'Services' }];
const visibleServices = services.filter((service) => service.published);
---

<Layout
 title="Therapy Services in Fort Collins, Colorado"
 description="Explore counseling for trauma, anxiety, grief, depression, chronic pain and illness, life transitions, relationships, and personal growth in Fort Collins, Colorado."
 schema={pageSchema([breadcrumbSchema(crumbs, Astro.url.pathname)])}
>
 <PageHero
 eyebrow="Individual counseling for adults"
 title="Support for what may be bringing you to therapy."
 intro="You do not need to fit your experience into one category before reaching out. Evergreen offers individual counseling for a range of concerns, with two focused service pages for some of the practice’s most common areas of support."
 crumbs={crumbs}
 />

 <section class="section">
 <div class="container grid grid--2">
 <div>
 <p class="eyebrow">Individual therapy</p>
 <h2>Begin with the concern, question, or change that matters to you.</h2>
 </div>

 <div>
 <p>
 Some people seek counseling because of a specific experience or
 symptom. Others notice patterns in emotions, relationships, stress,
 or daily life that they want to understand more clearly.
 </p>

 <p>
 Evergreen provides one-to-one counseling for adults. You can begin
 with what feels most important now and decide with Maya what deserves
 more attention as therapy develops.
 </p>
 </div>
 </div>
 </section>

 <section class="section section--tint" id="areas-of-support">
 <div class="container">
 <p class="eyebrow">Areas of support</p>
 <h2>Explore what may be bringing you to counseling.</h2>
 <p class="areas-intro measure">
 Trauma and anxiety have dedicated pages on this starter-size practice
 site. Other concerns are still represented here so visitors can quickly
 understand the breadth of support available without navigating a large
 collection of separate pages.
 </p>

 <div class="areas">
 {
 visibleServices.map((service) =>
 service.hasDetailPage ? (
 <a
 class="service-card service-link card"
 href={service.href}
 aria-label={`Learn more about ${service.title}`}
 data-track={`service-${service.slug}`}
 >
 <span class="detail-label">Focused service page</span>
 <h3>{service.title}</h3>
 <p>{service.description}</p>
 <span class="link-arrow">Learn more</span>
 </a>
 ) : (
 <article class="service-card card">
 <h3>{service.title}</h3>
 <p>{service.description}</p>
 </article>
 )
 )
 }
 </div>
 </div>
 </section>

 <section class="section">
 <div class="container grid grid--2">
 <div>
 <p class="eyebrow">How therapy may take shape</p>
 <h2>Services describe what brings you in. Maya’s approach shapes how the work unfolds.</h2>
 </div>

 <div>
 <p>
 Depending on your goals, Maya may draw from Internal Family Systems
 concepts, somatic awareness, emotionally focused work, mindfulness,
 and person-centered counseling. Those methods are used flexibly rather
 than as separate programs you have to choose before starting therapy.
 </p>

 <p>
 Her clinician profile explains more about how she works and what a
 collaborative counseling process can look like.
 </p>

 <a class="link-arrow" href="/about/maya-bennett/">
 Learn more about Maya’s approach
 </a>
 </div>
 </div>
 </section>

 <section class="section section--tint">
 <div class="container measure">
 <p class="eyebrow">Finding a place to begin</p>
 <h2>You can start without having the right label.</h2>

 <p>
 Experiences often overlap. If several areas sound familiar—or none of
 them describe your situation exactly—that does not prevent you from
 reaching out.
 </p>

 <a class="link-arrow" href="/contact/">
 Contact and getting started
 </a>
 </div>
 </section>
</Layout>

<style>
 .areas-intro{
 margin-top:1rem
 }

 .areas{
 display:grid;
 gap:.75rem;
 margin-top:2rem
 }

 .service-card{
 display:block;
 padding:1.2rem;
 color:var(--body);
 text-decoration:none;
 transition:
 transform .18s ease,
 box-shadow .18s ease,
 border-color .18s ease
 }

 .service-card h3{
 font-family:var(--sans);
 font-size:1rem;
 font-weight:700
 }

 .service-card p{
 font-size:.95rem
 }

 .detail-label{
 display:block;
 margin-bottom:.55rem;
 color:var(--clay-text);
 font-size:.68rem;
 font-weight:800;
 letter-spacing:.08em;
 text-transform:uppercase
 }

 .service-card .link-arrow{
 display:inline-flex;
 margin-top:.75rem
 }

 @media(hover:hover){
 a.service-card:hover{
 border-color:var(--sage);
 color:var(--body);
 box-shadow:var(--shadow);
 transform:translateY(-2px)
 }
 }

 @media(min-width:36rem){
 .areas{
 grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)
 }
 }

 @media(min-width:64rem){
 .areas{
 grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)
 }
 }
</style>
